  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CO-508412</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Mekong Alliance on Responsible Agricultural Investment refers to the group of organizations that will coordinate and lead activities on RAI at the regional scale during MRLG Phase 3 (2023-25). The Mekong RAI Alliance will continue to provide a platform for such exchanges and also act as a space for national alliance partners to tap into the expertise provided by regional alliance partnersto support their ongoing policy priorities. Oxfam will continue to lead engagement activities with the private sector specifically on rubber investments and value chains, with opportunities to share private sector engagement expertise with Grow Asia and TLI. Oxfam in Vietnam, Cambodia and Laos have been engaging with the VRG since 2015 and both side agreed to continue cooperation to promote sustainable and responsive investment for rubber production. During the Phase 2 project implementation, Oxfam has built strong and solid relationship with Vietnam Rubber Group (VRG) and its subsidiaries member in Cambodia and Laos. This phase 3, Oxfam will deploy some approaches and strategies to increase responsible and accountable of VRG on their investment both in Cambodia and Laos.</narrative>
  </description>
